  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://zap-hosting.com/reggarf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><span style=\"color: #2dc26b;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1162812/description_b0add901-8e9e-4418-845f-1e65c3f72df1.png\" width=\"762\" height=\"254\"></strong></span></a></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #2dc26b;\"><strong>感谢我们的赞助商</strong></span></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>感谢ZAP-HOSTING！使用优惠码 Reggarf-1047 可享受任何订单八折优惠！</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://zap-hosting.com/reggarf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">https://zap-hosting.com/reggarf</a></strong></p>\n<p><strong><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1162812/description_d346f672-075e-4fc3-b6b0-de2af7552b81.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"400\"></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/create-better-motors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/PzouXFuY?color=34D058&amp;label=Modrinth%20%E4%B8%8B%E8%BD%BD%E9%87%8F&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-better-motors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1162812?color=FC7303&amp;label=CurseForge%20%E4%B8%8B%E8%BD%BD%E9%87%8F&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/Reggarfgod/Create_Better_Motors/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/issues/Reggarfgod/Create_Better_Motors?color=6E40C9&amp;label=%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98&amp;logo=github\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/JBZxyKNNmY\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1188575775776051232?color=5865F2&amp;label=%E5%9C%A8%E7%BA%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%88%B7&amp;logo=discord\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #f1c40f;\"><strong>机械动力：更强电机</strong></span></h1>\n<p>用<strong>机械动力：更强电机</strong>为你的Minecraft世界注入超强动力！本模组引入了7款强大的电机，可将<strong>锻炉能量（<span style=\"color: #e03e2d;\">FE</span>）</strong>无缝转换为<strong>应力单位（<span style=\"color: #3598db;\">SU</span>）</strong>，为你的机械装置带来全新可能。</p>\n<p>主要特色：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #b96ad9;\"><strong>高效电机</strong></span>：通过7款专为优化性能设计的电机，将<span style=\"color: #e03e2d;\">FE</span>转换为<span style=\"color: #3598db;\">SU</span>。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #e67e23;\"><strong>高功率发电机</strong></span>：通过提供SU，最高可产生<strong>452 FE/t</strong>，完美适用于高能耗装置。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #2dc26b;\"><strong>完全可配置</strong></span>：通过可自定义设置，按需调整电机和发电机，确保与任何建筑或玩法兼容。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #3598db;\"><strong>瑞加方石矿</strong></span>：可在Y轴高度<span style=\"color: #e67e23;\">-64</span>至<span style=\"color: #e67e23;\">64</span>之间找到。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1162812/description_688e3c35-b99c-416a-9459-306b6c43f611.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"1277\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1162812/description_4ea1f30f-9788-44ea-b927-e71851f8eacd.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"762\" height=\"1354\"></p>",
